{"id":"navsegda","lemma":"навсегда","pos":"adv","rank":548,"glosses":["forever","once and for all"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8d/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B2%D1%81%D0%B5%D0%B3%D0%B4%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B2%D1%81%D0%B5%D0%B3%D0%B4%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Мы будем вместе навсегда.","en":"We will be together forever.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},{"g":"together"},null]},{"text":"Я хочу быть с тобой навсегда.","en":"I want to be with you forever.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"with / from"},{"g":"you","l":"ты"},null]},{"text":"Я не могу остаться здесь навсегда.","en":"I can't stay here forever.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to remain, to stay"},{"g":"here"},null]},{"text":"Смерть - это навсегда.","en":"Death is permanent.","words":[{"g":"death"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Я думал, что навсегда потерял тебя.","en":"I thought I'd lost you forever.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},{"g":"what / that"},null,{"g":"to lose, to waste","l":"потерять"},{"g":"you","l":"ты"}]}]}